<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Idea</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>idea
</pre>
<p>Got an idea to make the game better: a new area, a quest, a change to a 
skill or a guild? Tell the admins. Type idea and press enter, and the 
editor opens, as when you write a letter at the post office. Write your 
idea, up to about 4000 characters, and close the editor with @ on a line 
of its own. A single word or nothing at all is thrown away.
</p><p>Your idea is saved for the admins to read, together with your name and 
where you were, so if it is about a place, send it from there.
</p><p>Example:
</p>
<pre>42h&gt; idea
] The ferry to Udgaard could ring a bell before it leaves,
] so passengers on deck know to get on board.
] @
Thank you for your comments.
</pre>
<p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Bug</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Typo</a>
</pre>




</div>